5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I worry about the social friction if the parking rules get too rigid.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the morning shoving match. It’s getting quite rough down there.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of everyone asking for the budget without checking it. I need to know the actual costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about who actually maintains the racks. The last two duties just vanished because nobody owned them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I keep hearing the same doors get the best spots. I need to know if that’s actually true or just grumbling.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, I agree. The morning rush is where tensions peak. We need a system that prevents that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, yes, a gentle system would help. I’ve seen the rain damage the bikes left out overnight, too.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, vanished duties? That’s a red flag. I need to see if the money is actually going to maintenance or just disappearing into the void.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"@May, the money is there, but the work isn't. I need to see the physical effort involved before we promise anything.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, the morning rush is tough, but I’m also curious if the rain is making some spots unusable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, rain exposure is a real factor. If some spots are unusable, the ""best"" spots become even more contested.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, yes, the rain is a real problem. I’ve seen frames rusting. We need to know which spots are actually safe.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Mio, rain is a nuisance, but I care more about the cash flow. Who is actually paying for the current setup?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,"@May, the cash flow is fine. My concern is the labor. I need to know if the physical work is sustainable for one person.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@May, I get it, but if the spots are bad, people won't pay. I need to see the actual layout first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will check the last year's complaint log entries and the morning departures watched from the entrance.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will check the rain exposure along the parking rows and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I will check the building account's two-year ledger and the Treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I will check the five years of association minutes and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will check the sticker register and the daily riders and the last year's complaint log entries.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
